From 9be076fee6574141eda98d1176849bd4f53c7f70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reuben Ninan <reubenninan@yahoo.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:17:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let skins exit the app with window.decentApp.exitApp()

Adds exitApp() next to exitToDashboard() in the skin API script. The
skin navigates to /__decent/exit-app, which the skin view accepts only
from its own main frame. On Android this moves the task to the
background, so machine connections and wake schedules keep running;
desktop builds quit; iOS ignores it.

This lets skins restore the de1app's long-press-sleep behaviour: put
the machine to sleep and hand the tablet back to the user.

